# M-ALL01 -- Allied mission 1 (ALL01t, "Lone Guardian": Tanya + GIs, no base,
# TechLevel 3) started from the REAL shell: Single Player -> New Campaign ->
# Allied Campaign -> loading screen -> START. Checks the mission starts, its
# objectives arm, reinforcements arrive and the TechLevel cap holds.
# EXPECTED TO FAIL in places on master 63edea6 (docs/gap/PLAYTEST-STATUS.md).
set render_every 300
set on_quit continue

click button "Single Player"
click button "New Campaign"
require scene == "shell:Campaign"
click well:allied
click button Load
until 30 scene == campaign-load
require scene == campaign-load
assert side == GDI
shot loading
click start
until 300 scene == game
require scene == game
assert mode == campaign
shot start

# --- 1. the mission is live ----------------------------------------------------
# W4-MC-02/03: the original opens LOCKED on [Basic] HomeCell (wp98, the GIs on
# Liberty Island); the player's Tanya is staged off-board, so nothing of the
# player's own is on screen yet (own_on_screen excludes off-board units).
until 60 input_locked == 1                    @W4-MC-02
assert view_cx >= 52 and view_cx <= 61 and view_cy >= 66 and view_cy <= 75   @W4-MC-03
assert own_on_screen == 0                     @W4-MC-04
assert units(0) > 0
until 900 objectives >= 1
assert triggers_fired > 0
key f1
wait 2
assert briefing_open == 1
key f1
wait 2
assert briefing_open == 0

# --- 2. TechLevel 3 caps the sidebar (no Weather Device / Prism Tower / Battle Lab) --
assert cameo(GAWEAT) == 0                     @G-15:F
assert cameo(GATECH) == 0                     @G-15:F

# --- 3. reinforcements (Tanya) arrive -----------------------------------------------
until 2700 units(0,TANY) >= 1                 @G-73:F

# --- 4. Esc mid-mission opens the options menu, not quit ------------------------------
# (R-210: checked while the mission certainly runs -- with no input Tanya now
# follows the paratroopers toward the Dreadnoughts and the map may end LOST
# before the 1800-frame wait below is over.)
key esc                                       @G-01:B
wait 2
assert quits == 0                             @G-01:B
assert menu_open == 1                         @G-01:B
if menu_open == 1 then key esc
wait 2

# --- 5. the mission keeps running, or says it is lost --------------------------------
wait 1800
# With no player input the mission may be lost; it must then SAY so (the map's
# "Lose 13" chain / house defeat -> BorrowedTime -> result screen).
if scene == game and units(0) == 0 then assert outcome == LOST  @NEW-2:F
if scene == game and units(0) > 0 then assert outcome == RUNNING
if scene == result then assert outcome == LOST
shot f2400
end
